WEBVTT

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:38.530
Masayoshi-kun, are you Samurai Flamenco?

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:44.790
No, I'm not.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.040
You aren't Flamenco?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.040
I'm not.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.290
Really?

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.460
I'm not.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.750
If you're lying, I'll kill you!

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.260
I'm not.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:00.910
Fine, that works for me.

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.890
Sorry to bother you on your day off.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:04.100
It's okay.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.270
I should get going, then.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.780
<b>Flamenco vs. Fake Flamenco</b>

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.000
Man, I thought my cover was blown.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.800
You think it isn't?

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.410
It isn't.

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:39.060
Otherwise, I wouldn't be alive.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:40.450
Money Rangers! Money Rangers!

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:43.300
Ishihara-san sounds like a terror.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.230
He'll kick the right one, then the left.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:52.350
How did you know?

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:54.970
Action scenes use certain patterns.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:57.110
After years of observation,
 I've memorized them!

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:01.530
Your action knowledge didn't help when you got 
beat up by middle schoolers and a drunk.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.540
I try to work out, but...

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.490
Maybe I need a weapon.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:09.080
<i>Money Slash!</i>

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.160
Goto-san...

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:13.380
What?

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.630
Do you have a spare gun lying around?

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.000
The early bird catches the worm!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.010
Money Rangers!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.260
I don't believe this!

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.760
How dumb are you?

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.470
I was just kidding.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.640
No, you were serious!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:31.920
If I'd said yes, you would have asked for it.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:32.940
You have one?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:33.520
No!

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.360
Of course not...

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.280
Guess I'll have to find my own weapon.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.280
Um, are you Hazama Masayoshi-san,

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.480
the model?

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:43.660
Ah, yes!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:44.920
I knew it...

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.860
I saw the MMM music video!

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:49.160
You were awesome!

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.230
Okay, cheese.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.370
Cheese!

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.180
Thank you very much.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:55.790
Sure.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:59.050
Are you Samurai Flamenco, Hazama-san?

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.300
I'm n-not.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.390
See? I told you it wasn't him.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.180
From behind, they look really similar...

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:11.110
Why do you ask?

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:12.470
Because of this.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.690
<b>Unmask Samurai Flamenco! 
Reward: 1,000,000 Yen</b>

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:18.020
On TV, Hazama-san mentioned he watched the video a bunch of times.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.690
A million yen, huh?

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:24.590
What's with that look?

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:25.700
You gonna sell me out?

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:26.950
Throw me under the bus?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.710
I wouldn't do that.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:31.330
Cops aren't supposed to do that kind of thing.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.830
That's your reason?

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.910
Heroes always struggle to 
protect their identities,

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.840
but I didn't expect a reward.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.580
Here you are.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:45.760
Enjoy.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.460
Did she recognize me?

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:52.220
Hell if I know.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.980
Why would someone do this?

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.600
Because it's entertaining.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:00.990
For entertainment, I would do anything.

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:04.110
Even if I cause trouble for others in the process.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.800
So what did you want?

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:07.610
You see,

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:11.770
they took a survey to learn who 
people think Samurai Flamenco is,

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.250
and Hazama-kun was in the top five.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.620
So I was hoping for an interview.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:18.290
Hazama?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:21.880
He probably drew attention to himself 
with that statement on TV...

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.800
I decline your interview request.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:28.430
Hazama has nothing to do with that mess.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.340
Oh, really?

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:31.890
In that case, Ishihara-san...

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:35.160
Would you care to join me 
for some horumon tonight?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.390
No, I'm already booked.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:39.150
How about some beef tendon tomorrow?

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:40.410
Goodbye.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.280
Ishihara-san...

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.990
You have a call from an FTV director...

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.290
<b>The Wow Show 
Hazama Masayoshi</b>

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:55.290
This is your chance.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.670
If they bring up the topic, tell the truth.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:01.440
"I am not Samurai Flamenco!"

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.900
You aren't, right?

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.420
O-Of course not...

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.430
Anyway, it doesn't matter 
who Samurai Flamenco is.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:14.620
From now on, you are to have 
nothing to do with superheroes!

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.940
Hello...

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.180
Konno-san?

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:21.690
Why are you here?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.190
I was invited as a guest on this show, as well.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:29.500
It seems they'll be talking about 
Samurai Flamenco today.

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:33.200
The Wow Show!

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:38.210
On video sharing sites, this man 
is attracting a lot of attention.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:40.960
He goes by Samurai Flamenco.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:48.030
Footage of his nightly escapades 
has been posted everywhere.

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.840
Who is this man?

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:55.090
Why does he patrol the streets 
as Samurai Flamenco?

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:57.820
Tonight, we will unravel the mystery!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:58.350
<b>Samurai Flamenco the Superhero?? 
Who Is He!?</b>

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:01.930
In a previous episode, we introduced 
everyone to Samurai Flamenco.

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:03.610
He's gotten a lot of attention lately...

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.610
Yes, he's gotten tons of views.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:10.620
And look at what everything has led to...

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:23.750
<b>Hazama Masayoshi                           Konno Akira</b>

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:14.920
A reward of one million yen for whoever 
unmasks Samurai Flamenco!

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:17.870
This reward is being offered by 
Konno-san, of HIGH ROLLERS.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.580
Have you gotten any feedback?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.840
Absolutely.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.750
On the first day, we received 
five hundred responses.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.610
Oh! And do you know his true identity now?

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.870
We're down to a fairly narrow list of candidates.

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:33.170
But you still don't know who it is?

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.260
No, we don't.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:40.080
Well, after conducting a thorough investigation,

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.900
this program has determined 
Samurai Flamenco-san's identity!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:48.900
<b>Samurai Flamenco the Superhero?? 
Who Is He!?</b>

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:47.770
We will now announce his identity.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:53.030
Are you ready, Hazama-san?

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.100
What happened?

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.920
Huh? Power's out?

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.030
Huh? What?

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.320
Wait!

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:18.560
Release him!

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.680
Hate not your fellow man, 
but the evil beguiling him.

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:25.940
They call me Samurai Flamenco!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.190
Huh?

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.930
<i>Dancing Kick!</i>

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:47.490
Allow us to introduce the hero that's 
all the buzz, Samurai Flamenco-san!

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.760
I'm glad you could join us—

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.030
Cut! Stop rolling!

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.760
F-Flamenco-san?

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.220
Sorry about that...

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:04.850
Whenever a fight starts, I have 
a tendency to lose control.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:08.640
That voice belongs to Red Axe, 
the Armored God...

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.880
Kaname Joji-san!

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.610
Way to go.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.220
Axe?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.120
Seventeen years ago, 
Kaname Joji made his debut

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:39.140
starring on the superhero show 
<i>Red Axe the Armored God</i>.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:58.280
He continues to perform dangerous 
stunts without using a double.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.620
A living legend,

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.580
a true action star!

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.660
With immense strength...

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:17.710
But with a gentle heart, he is a modern samurai.

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:19.340
Look at you...

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:25.510
Kaname Joji has now returned as 
a new hero, Samurai Flamenco!

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:33.160
Once again, with us, we have the real 
Samurai Flamenco, Kaname Joji-san.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.690
Hello, everyone.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.030
You see, back when I was young,

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:45.820
society placed more importance on ethics, 
manners, and etiquette in general.

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:47.370
Wouldn't you agree?

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.660
Um, I guess...

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:52.200
I cannot stand by as society crumbles around me.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:56.920
And when I get worked up, 
I tend to lose control...

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:59.170
No kidding...

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:01.970
We must teach kids right from wrong.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:05.430
Teach them the spirit of the samurai!

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:08.180
That's why I created this new hero.

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:11.300
That's why you used the name "Samurai Flamenco"?

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:12.440
Exactly!

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.820
But one of the videos showed you getting 
beat up by a bunch of middle schoolers.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:20.320
Ah, if I were to use my full strength, 
I could end up killing my opponent.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.760
Seriously fighting an amateur wouldn't be right...

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:26.000
My top priority is to ensure my message is heard.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.910
<b>Move on to the million yen!</b>

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.420
I talk to offenders till they understand.

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:28.350
Makes sense, yes?

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:33.530
Um, Kaname-san hadn't planned 
to reveal his identity...

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:36.870
But after seeing the attention he was receiving,

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:39.970
he reached out to this program.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:42.800
I wanted everyone to understand 
what I'm trying to do!

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:47.060
And what about the 
million yen, Konno-san?

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.440
Huh?

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:49.930
Oh, it's all yours, of course.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.830
Kaname-san, you've won a million yen.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.270
What will you do with it?

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:57.070
I will donate it to a center for youth learning.

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:00.540
He's a true hero!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.390
That was money well spent.

00:12:02.390 --> 00:12:05.700
And what's wrong with you, Hazama-san?

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.880
You look about to keel over.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.200
It's just my nerves...

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.600
He must be thrilled, meeting one 
of the heroes he worships.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:19.480
Hazama-san is a big fan who's watched the 
Samurai Flamenco video two hundred times.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.720
I like the sound of that...

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:23.580
What's your name?

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.800
H-Hazama Masayoshi.

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:28.920
Thank you, Masayoshi-kun.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.600
I'm counting on your continued support.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.600
R-Right.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.110
The Wow Show will continue

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:42.860
to follow Samurai Flamenco, AKA Kaname Joji-san.

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:49.160
Next time, we're moving to prime time with 
a live special featuring Samurai Flamenco

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:54.550
as he patrols the streets and 
apprehends suspicious characters!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.870
<b>Produced by</b>

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:56.870
Flamenco is watching over your city!

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:02.330
What the hell? There's already a fake?

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:03.380
It's too soon.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:08.540
I guess you aren't in the mood 
to pick yourself up...

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:12.290
Why is Kaname-san lying?

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.140
He probably has his reasons.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.970
Like what?

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:18.780
I wouldn't know... Ask him.

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:22.900
Do you own <i>Red Axe</i>?

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:25.400
Yes, of course.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.960
VHS, LD, DVD, Blu-ray.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.470
Take your pick.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.750
<i>Wreck him!</i>

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:47.640
He used to be pretty cool.

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:50.760
No, he's still cool.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:51.930
Too cool.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.920
I got his signature!

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:55.930
Why would you do that?

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.940
I've been watching since I was a kid.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.710
<i>Change Axe!</i>

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:05.690
A!

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:07.320
X!

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:07.950
E!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:12.950
<i>Way to go.</i>

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.360
So, what are you gonna do?

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:24.780
Personally, I'd rather not 
embarrass Kaname-san.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.590
I don't want to ruin his image...

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:32.250
Maybe the solution is to let him 
take over Samurai Flamenco.

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:35.600
Sure, if you're really okay with that.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.360
As long as you won't regret it...

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.110
<b>Kaname Joji Entertainment Agency</b>

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:46.110
It's been years since you had so much fan mail.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:51.090
I'm always happy to receive support 
from anyone out there.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.020
You've also gotten a lot of e-mail...

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:55.740
It's coming from a new, younger audience!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.500
<b>Challenge</b>

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.010
<b>Two Red Axes! 
Which Is Fake?</b>

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.260
Is something wrong?

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.140
Where's Kaname-san?

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:23.270
He said he was running late.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.530
There you are, fake!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:41.300
Huh?

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:43.570
Y-You're the fake!

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.420
That isn't for you to say!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.800
Justice will prevail!

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:51.670
I'm the real Samurai Flamenco.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:54.800
Could you stop lying and using my name?

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.870
I refuse.

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.050
Huh?!

00:15:57.050 --> 00:16:00.060
I'm stronger and more famous than you.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:03.950
With me as Samurai Flamenco, 
the world is better off.

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:05.190
Er, but...

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:08.190
And why do you refuse to reveal your identity?

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:09.690
You're a coward!

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:12.690
If you feel no guilt, remove the mask!

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:13.820
Show your face!

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:16.790
Let the world see your true self!

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:18.360
Very well.

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:19.330
H-Hey...

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.660
It's okay.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.580
I am the real...

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:26.840
Samurai Flamenco!

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.420
Who are you?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.320
Huh?

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:35.390
We just met on that TV program...

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:36.600
You don't remember me?

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.500
No, I remember you.

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:42.250
But I can't match your name and face...

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.020
Then you don't remember!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.730
I'm Hazama Masayoshi...

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.100
You gave me your autograph!

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:50.130
Oh! Ah, I remember...

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:53.110
So you're Samurai Flamenco?

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:54.990
Seriously?

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.850
That makes this easier.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:01.500
Hazama-kun, I have seniority in both the 
entertainment and superhero worlds.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:04.200
Let me have Samurai Flamenco!

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:07.250
No.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.310
Can't you see that I'm begging?

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:10.750
No, I can't!

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:14.490
Very well, I've heard enough.

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:18.420
It's quite clear that I would make 
a better Samurai Flamenco...

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:21.770
If you insist on standing in 
my way, you must be evil!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.520
How does that make sense?

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:28.060
Let's decide which is the real Flamenco.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:31.780
I'm telling you that I'm the real one!

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:36.610
Huh? Hazama-kun isn't here?

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:39.490
He had a conflict today.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.300
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:43.080
They can't find him!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.630
We're gonna be live!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:49.290
Tonight, we have Samurai Flamenco 
live and in the flesh!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:03.720
No offense, but you're really weak.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.430
I don't need you to tell me that...

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:11.230
In that case, I can't let you 
have Samurai Flamenco.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:13.980
It was mine to begin with.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:17.700
A weak hero is powerless to save anyone.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:20.720
That isn't true!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:24.370
You're Red Axe,

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.390
and I'm Samurai Flamenco.

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:27.960
If I let you maintain this ruse,

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:32.340
I would be demeaning Red Axe 
and Samurai Flamenco...

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.600
So here's what I say.

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:36.950
I say that you are the fake.

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:40.310
I do this to save Red Axe and Samurai Flamenco!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:48.600
Because that's all I, the real 
Samurai Flamenco, can do right now.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.360
Wake up, Red Axe!

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:53.610
Stop pretending to be Samurai Flamenco!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.860
If you don't, I will punish you!

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.330
I love it!

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:08.270
You've come a long way...

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:09.830
I knew I could bring out your potential.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.080
What?!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.960
Convincing a friend they're 
doing something wrong

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:16.340
is the hardest thing you'll ever do.

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:19.080
That's what I wanted to teach you.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:19.840
Eh?

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.550
No, that's a lie!

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.460
My job is done...

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:28.370
I'm glad I could help you grow.

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:30.190
N-No, I should thank you.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.190
Don't let him fool you!

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:36.440
I now dub you the second Samurai Flamenco!

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:38.790
Right!

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:41.200
<b>Up Next: Samurai Flamenco!</b>

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:43.020
<i>Everyone was walking out of the restaurant,</i>

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:47.040
<i>but one of the younger kids was 
taking a long time, and...</i>

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.080
<i>Oh, we have footage from Shibuya!</i>

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:56.460
<b>Up Next: Samurai Flamenco!</b>

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:53.220
<i>Ladies and gentlemen, it's the moment 
you've been waiting for...</i>

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.590
<i>Samurai Flamenco!</i>

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:56.460
<i>Let's go to Oda-san, in Shibuya.</i>

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.260
Yes, uh...

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:00.010
Wait, Kaname-san?

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:02.130
You haven't changed into Samurai Flamenco?

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:06.800
Citizens, I am not Samurai Flamenco.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.390
Huh? W-Wait, what do you mean?

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:13.700
I am Red Axe, and Samurai 
Flamenco is my student!

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:14.480
Student?!

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:18.360
Where is Samurai Flamenco, then?

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:19.680
Up there!

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:28.240
Oh, it's Samurai Flamenco.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:32.570
Is something wrong?

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:35.730
<i>Whoa...</i>

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:38.380
<i>This feels really good!</i>

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:42.010
It isn't him.

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:15.900
Hey...

00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:18.970
Is curry still big in sentai superhero shows?

00:22:22.740 --> 00:22:26.200
No, but the tradition continues.

00:22:29.650 --> 00:22:33.990
It's a common misconception that the 
Yellow Ranger eats a lot of curry.

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:40.360
Okay, let's take a fifteen-minute break 
before we continue to spar!

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:41.330
Yes, sir!

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:43.000
I'm gonna train you hard, junior!

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:43.750
Yes, sir!

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:46.560
Wait... I'm the original!

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:50.010
<b>Idol Devastation</b>

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:55.010
<b>Way to Go Next Time, Too!</b>
